WEBVTT


00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:01.360
hei what's up guys

00:00:01.361 --> 00:00:02.801
so siapa kat sini peminat tempe

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:05.600
hari ni kita nak buat tempe goreng crispy aa

00:00:05.601 --> 00:00:06.801
krukrak krukrak bunyi dia

00:00:06.802 --> 00:00:08.561
boleh cicah dengan sambal kicap pedas ni

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:09.640
sangatlah sedap

00:00:09.641 --> 00:00:12.121
so korang ambil 6 ulas eh belum lagi he he

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.320
ambil tempe dulu tempe aa kita potong potong 2

00:00:15.321 --> 00:00:16.961
yang dia potong nipis nipis nipis aa

00:00:16.962 --> 00:00:18.641
lagi nipis lagi krispilah aa

00:00:18.642 --> 00:00:20.201
baru ambil 6 ulas bawang putih

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:21.880
1 sudu biji ketumbar

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.240
separuh kiub pati ayam

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:24.560
separuh biji bawang merah

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:27.280
and then tambahkan gula lebih kurang 1 sudu kecil

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.160
and then tambahkan garam dengan Ajinomoto

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:30.520
and then tambahkan white pepper

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:33.160
and letakkan 1 sudu tepung jagung

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.040
